## Notes

- I treated "key whose name contains" as a substring match (e.g. `mySecret`, `apiToken`, `user_password` all redact), consistent with the wording.
- The secret-key match is applied at every point the key's value would be written; the bearer redaction only applies to string values (non-string bearer tokens aren't a thing).
- The existing logger test was left intact and still passes.

